      "title": "[Estimated population of China at various dates]",
      "caption_extra": "The subjoined tables show the estimated population at various dates (obtained from various sources and abstracted chiefly from \"The Middle Kingdom\") and the latest official estimates of the population:—",
      "continued": false,
